## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- EMA18: `iMA(NULL,PERIOD_H1,18,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- ADX: `iADXWilder(NULL,PERIOD_H1,12,PRICE_CLOSE,MODE_MAIN,1)` > 25
- First-touch: track a bool `in_pullback_zone`; set true when `Low[1] <= EMA18[1]`; reset when price > EMA18 by >5 pips for 2+ bars; only enter on FIRST bar where condition is true
- BUYSTOP: `iHigh(NULL,PERIOD_H1,1) + 1*_Point` (adjust for 5-digit brokers)
- Trail: once `iClose(NULL,PERIOD_H1,0) - entry > ATR`, move SL to EMA18[0] - small buffer
- P3 sweeps: EMA period (13/18/21), ADX threshold (20/25/30), ATR TP (1.5/2.0/3.0)

